/*
# Replace catalog with marketplace products matching the live reference site

1. Changes
- Archives all existing products by setting status = 'archived'.
- Inserts a new set of ~28 active products across 6 categories (electronics, clothing, shoes-sneakers, home-living, beauty-personal-care, sports-outdoors).
- Each product has a real Pexels image URL, brand, price, compare_at_price (for sale items), stock, sizes, colors, and flags (is_new, is_featured, is_best_seller).
- Existing orders, coupons, shipping settings, payment info, and admin RPCs are untouched.

2. Security
- No new tables. No RLS or policy changes. No grants added or removed.
- All inserts respect existing column constraints on the products table.

3. Important Notes
- Old products are archived (not deleted) so prior orders retain valid references.
- New SKUs use a V- prefix and are unique.
- Images are high-quality Pexels stock photos referenced directly by URL.
*/

UPDATE products SET status = 'archived' WHERE status = 'active';

