('orbit-smart-speaker', 'Orbit Smart Speaker', 'electronics', 'Speakers', 'Voice-controlled smart speaker with room-filling audio.', 'Orbit combines premium room-filling audio with a built-in voice assistant. Stream music, control smart home devices, and set routines.', 65.00, 80.00, 'V-EL-007', ARRAY[''], ARRAY['Charcoal', 'Sand'], ARRAY['https://images.pexels.com/photos/34241691/pexels-photo-34241691.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940','https://images.pexels.com/photos/36326800/pexels-photo-36326800.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940'], 40, true, false, false, 'active'),
